OL,3,GNEWSAThe city grappling with unreliable
OL,4,Aphone signal
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a time when we rely so much on our
OL,7,Fmobile phones, it can be frustrating
OL,8,Fwhen you cannot find good signal. In
OL,9,Fsome towns and cities with so-called
OL,10,Fnotspots - areas with patchy, slow, or
OL,11,Fmissing network coverage - a type of
OL,12,Ftechnology involving lamp-posts could
OL,13,Fhelp eradicate the issue.
OL,15,FIt is a mild Thursday morning and
OL,16,Fmarket traders are busy serving
OL,17,Fcustomers in the cathedral city of Ely,
OL,18,FCambridgeshire.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
