OL,3,GNEWSAThe city grappling with unreliable
OL,4,Aphone signal
OL,5,
OL,6,FI have never been to the city before,
OL,7,Fbut a lot of people I know warned me
OL,8,Fabout the area's poor mobile
OL,9,Fconnection.
OL,11,FAmong a group of tourists visiting Ely
OL,12,Ffrom Middlesbrough is Lauren Atkinson,
OL,13,Fwho says she has found it hard to find
OL,14,Fher way around because the signal is
OL,15,Fnot good enough to use a maps app on
OL,16,Fher phone.
